###### INVOICES ######
### Invoice umumnya terbit OTOMATIS via event:
### - order takeaway baru     → invoice standalone (StandaloneOrderCreatedEvent)
### - order masuk ke dining   → invoice dining (DiningOrderAddedEvent, satu invoice per sesi)
### Endpoint di bawah untuk inspeksi & aksi kasir.

### Search active or GetAll
### filter: keyword (invoiceNumber), status (OPEN|PARTIALLY_PAID|PAID|VOID), diningId, orderId
### default sort createdAt,desc; pagination standar page=&size=
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?keyword=INV&status=OPEN&orderId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search - invoice satu sesi dining (1 sesi = 1 invoice)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?diningId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create (manual, jarang dipakai — invoice dining tanpa diningId akan dianggap standalone)
### items.orderItemId harus unik per invoice; amount = quantity * unitPrice
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "diningId": null,
    "items": [
        {
            "orderItemId": 1,
            "orderId": 1,
            "description": "Americano",
            "quantity": 2,
            "unitPrice": 18000,
            "amount": 36000
        }
    ]
}


### ========================================
### VOID & DELETE
### ========================================

### Void — hanya untuk invoice OPEN/PARTIALLY_PAID tanpa... (PAID → 400 "Cannot void a PAID invoice")
### Invoice dining di-void → sesi masih bisa ditutup (guard close menerima VOID), addOrder ditolak.
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1/void
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete (soft delete) — invalid jika PAID/PARTIALLY_PAID (400 "Cannot delete an invoice with applied payment")
### Invalid juga jika invoice dining dan sesinya masih OPEN (400 "Tutup sesi dulu sebelum menghapus tagihan")
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### VALIDATION
### ====================================

### Not found (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CATATAN (B2): tidak ada lagi POST /invoices/{id}/payments.
### Satu-satunya jalur uang adalah POST /payments (lihat payment.http).



